  "bodyHash": "k1G+bzFYnVQ=",
  "content": "<p><span>你是否曾觉得获得全套钻石装备太快太容易？</span></p><p>那么你来对地方了。\"钻石之上矿石\"模组新增了<span style=\"color:#c9f\">紫水晶</span>与<span style=\"color:#800080\">黑欧泊</span>这两种终局宝石，它们比钻石稀有得多，但性能也显著更强。</p><p><strong>本模组提供1.12.2、1.14.4、1.15.2、1.16.5、1.17.1及1.18.2版本，请于页面顶部的\"文件\"标签页中查找。</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rshVJOw.png\" alt=\"OAD模组展示\" width=\"660\" height=\"410\"></p><p><span style=\"color:#c9f\"><strong>紫水晶：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#c9f\">生成于Y坐标8以下（1.17-版本为Y坐标16以下）</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#c9f\">需钻石及以上镐开采</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#c9f\">稀有度为钻石的3倍</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#c9f\">效率比钻石高50%</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#c9f\">耐久度为钻石的1.75倍</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#c9f\">攻击伤害比钻石+1</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#c9f\">附魔能力比钻石+25</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#c9f\">单件护甲韧性比钻石+1</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#c9f\">全套伤害减免80%+4%</span></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- 相比钻石护甲<span style=\"color:#c9f\">最高可提升25%防御力</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#c9f\"><strong>1.17+版本 - 可粉碎为3个原版紫水晶碎片</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">若在配置文件中启用</span>，可在<span style=\"color:#c9f\"><strong>下界</strong></span><em>与</em><span style=\"color:#c9f\"><strong>终界</strong></span>中生成，且支持高度自定义！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#800080\">黑欧泊：</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#800080\">生成于Y坐标0以下（1.17-版本为Y坐标16以下）</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#800080\">需紫水晶及以上镐开采</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#800080\">稀有度为钻石的9倍</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#800080\">效率比钻石高100%</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#800080\">耐久度为钻石的3.5倍</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#800080\">攻击伤害比钻石+2</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#800080\">附魔能力比钻石+5</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#800080\">单件护甲韧性比钻石+2</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#800080\">全套伤害减免80%+8%</span></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- 相比钻石护甲<span style=\"color:#800080\">最高可提升60%防御力</span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">若在配置文件中启用</span>，可在<span style=\"color:#800080\"><strong>下界</strong></span><em>与</em><span style=\"color:#800080\"><strong>终界</strong></span>中生成，且支持高度自定义！</p><p><span><strong><span style=\"color:#800080\">1.16+版本 - 可升级为狱髓欧泊：</span></strong><span style=\"color:#800080\">+1攻击伤害、+20%效率与耐久、+1韧性、+1击退抗性、+5附魔能力</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#800080\">（使用锻造台搭配狱髓锭）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.desmos.com%252fcalculator%252f6d2l77hwkl\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处可查看护甲有效生命值（Y轴）随伤害值（X轴）变化的可视化图表</a></span></p><p><strong>所有数值均可通过<span style=\"color:#f00\">配</span><span style=\"color:#f60\">置<span style=\"color:#f90\">文</span></span><span style=\"color:#396\">件</span><span style=\"color:#36f\">自</span><span style=\"color:#00f\">定</span><span style=\"color:#f0f\">义</span></strong></p><p>除1.12.2版本外，若将本模组添加到现有世界，矿石仅会在新生成的区块中生成。你需要深入未探索区域才有机会找到这些矿石。</p><p>护甲视觉栏位上限为10格，但实际提供更高伤害减免。</p><p>部分版本可下载<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/overloaded-armor-bar\" rel=\"nofollow\">Overloaded Armor Bar</a>修正此问题。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>配置教程</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>Windows系统请搜索%appdata%，进入.minecraft → config文件夹查找oresabovediamonds.toml文件</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00\">多数配置更改需完全重启Minecraft及/或服务器</span></p>\n<p>服务器端配置<strong>会自动同步至客户端</strong>！玩家需加入服务器→重启游戏→重新加入服务器。默认情况下加入时会自动收到这些指示（可在配置中关闭）</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#800080\"><strong>1.16.5与1.18.1版本预期与实际矿石分布</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>1.16.5</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/c6O4xfl.png\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#c9f\">紫水晶预期：</span>&nbsp;14194 * (7/8) / 3 = <strong>4139</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#936\"><span style=\"color:#800080\">黑欧泊预期</span>：</span>&nbsp;14194 * (6/8) / 9 =&nbsp; <strong>1182</strong></p>\n<p><strong>1.18.1</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/n97Dbxg.png\" alt=\"1.18.1实际分布\" width=\"469\" height=\"95\"></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#c9f\">紫水晶预期：</span>&nbsp;57455&nbsp; / 3 = <strong>19152</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#800080\">黑欧泊预期：</span>&nbsp;57455&nbsp; / 9 =&nbsp; <strong><strong>6383</strong></strong></p>\n<p>（1.18.1+版本矿脉大小均为8，与钻石相同）</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>推荐搭配模组</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extended-caves\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extended Caves</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-beasts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mutant Beasts</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/colytra\" rel=\"nofollow\">Colytra (Forge)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/progressive-bosses\" rel=\"nofollow\">Progressive Bosses</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-caves\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Caves</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ticbc\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tinkers Better Compat (ianm1647制作的1.16.5匠魂兼容模组)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/projecte\" rel=\"nofollow\">ProjectE (可通过指令手动添加EMC值)</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>优秀替代模组：<span style=\"color:#000\"><a style=\"color:#000\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite\" rel=\"nofollow\">Advanced Netherite</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gobber\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gobber</a>、</span><span style=\"color:#36f\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><a style=\"color:#000\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gems-jewels\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gems &amp; Jewels!</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00\">虽然Gems &amp; Jewels的宝石理论上兼容，但戒指功能暂未适配，若不想选择工具套装需二选一使用</span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>鸣谢</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span>感谢<a style=\"background-color:#ffffff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/criativeman1/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">CriativeMan1</a>自愿创作几乎所有纹理，以及所有翻译人员：</span></p>\n<p>俄语翻译由<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/marrssssss/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">mARRSSSSS</a>与<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/marmotinfire/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">marmotinfire</a>提供</p>\n<p>巴西葡萄牙语翻译由<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/damagemaximo15/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">damagemaximo15</a>提供</p>\n<p>土耳其语翻译由<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/jesrass\" rel=\"nofollow\">jesrass</a>提供</p>\n<p>中文翻译由<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/wadjet_sama\" rel=\"nofollow\">wadjet_sama</a>提供</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>欢迎随时留言或私信交流。提交错误报告请注明Minecraft版本。期待您的建议，虽然目前仅维护本模组，但很乐意听取创意，未来可能推出重制版。</p>\n\n（注：根据繁体中文用语习惯调整了部分术语，如\"下界\"保留原称而非\"地狱\"，\"终界\"替代\"末地\"，\"镐\"替代\"稿\"，\"附魔\"替代\"附魔\"，数值表达采用本地化格式）",
